      "id": "claim_8faf63010136478bab74810e2172bd5e",
      "statement": "A checkpoint is complete only when model_step_N.safetensors, optim_step_N.pt, and meta_step_N.json exist; latest_step() and list_checkpoints() filter on that required triple, while scheduler and RNG artifacts are optional for completeness.",
