      "id": "claim_50e89c665e374a6994468c339527f5a5",
      "statement": "Each checkpoint artifact is written through a sibling temporary file in save_dir and committed with os.replace, with best-effort temporary-file cleanup on failure; this provides atomic individual-file replacement but an interrupted multi-file save can still leave an incomplete checkpoint set.",
