    {
      "id": "claim_48cd8359bb574857b67480fe083dd482",
      "statement": "Checkpoint loading requires the model safetensors file, validates missing and unexpected keys after a non-strict state-dict load, and in strict mode raises RuntimeError for key mismatches; absent optimizer or scheduler artifacts produce distinct warnings and leave the supplied runtime state unchanged, while absent metadata falls back to the requested step.",
