      "statement": "Pretraining resume restores model, optimizer, scheduler, metadata, and an optional Python/NumPy/PyTorch/CUDA RNG snapshot; absent RNG state is silently skipped, and the persisted RNG sidecar is written after the final checkpoint and is not part of CheckpointManager completeness.",
