      "statement": "The estimator distinguishes prefill/training and inference steady-state KV sizing: without steady_state, windowed layers are charged max(window, sequence length), while steady_state charges only the window for windowed layers and the full sequence for global layers; the mixed-cache runtime uses ring buffers for windowed layers and growing buffers for global layers.",
